description: Maya testing — unit, security, smoke, evals, doctor
alwaysApply: true
---

Testing rules:

- New skills get a typed module plus a unit or smoke check.
- Permission and path-policy changes need `npm test`.
- After chat/tool changes, `npm run smoke` against the running server.
- Evals in `tests/evals/` measure memory honesty and hallucination offline.
- `npm run doctor` must pass the offline core (Node, SQLite, workspace, Python, vault).
- Do not add paid API tests. Network tests may skip when offline.
